lang=EN-GB style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>olarak
tahmin edilmiştir.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
